---
/**
 * The MeowCoder wordmark lockup (MCD-28).
 *
 * A cat face built from two coding brackets, beside the MeowCoder wordmark.
 * It sits in the footer, which is where PRD §42's brand model puts the site
 * itself — `Site Engineering · meowcoder.com` at the base of the tree, with
 * `Oliver Yu` at the top. The header therefore keeps the plain-text name and
 * this mark never competes with it (doc-2 §1).
 *
 * Inlined rather than referenced through `<img>` for two reasons: the artwork
 * paints with `currentColor`, so inlining is what lets it inherit the footer's
 * text color and follow light/dark without a second asset; and an inline SVG
 * costs no extra request.
 *
 * Two deliberate changes from the source asset:
 *
 *   - `font-family` was `Inter`, which this site does not load — no web font
 *     ships at all (PRD §26). It now uses the same system stack as
 *     `--font-sans`, so the wordmark is set in the same face as every other
 *     word on the page rather than silently falling back to something else.
 *   - The asset's `<title id="title">` / `<desc id="desc">` were dropped in
 *     favour of `role="img"` + `aria-label`. Those ids are generic enough to
 *     collide with anything else on the page, and one accessible name is
 *     exactly what this needs.
 *
 * The name is the domain, so it is not translated (PRD §7).
 */
---

<svg
  class="brand-wordmark"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  viewBox="0 0 560 128"
  width="105"
  height="24"
  role="img"
  aria-label="meowcoder.com"
>
  <g fill="currentColor">
    <!-- Cat ears -->
    <path d="M42 38 L50 10 L72 30 Z"></path>
    <path d="M102 30 L124 10 L132 38 Z"></path>

    <!-- Nose -->
    <path d="M78 70 L96 70 L87 82 Z"></path>
  </g>

  <!-- Coding brackets / cheeks -->
  <g
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="9"
    stroke-linecap="square"
    stroke-linejoin="miter"
  >
    <path d="M61 51 L31 66 L61 81"></path>
    <path d="M113 51 L143 66 L113 81"></path>
  </g>

  <text
    x="170"
    y="82"
    fill="currentColor"
    font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif"
    font-size="62"
    font-weight="700"
    letter-spacing="-2.2">MeowCoder</text
  >
</svg>

<style>
  /* Explicit intrinsic size on the element plus a fixed box here: the footer
     must not reflow once the SVG paints. */
  .brand-wordmark {
    display: block;
    width: 105px;
    height: 24px;
  }
</style>
